  "description": "Located in the heart of Doughiska this two bedroom property is walking distance to a host of amenities, including parks, playing fields, supermarkets and restaurants.  Overlooking a green area the property is located on the ground floor in a block of 3 apartments.  Comprising of tiled entrance hall with cloak room, leading to the open plan living / dining /kitchen area to the left.  This living space comes with large bay window, where each zone has its designated space.   The kitchen if fully equipped with separate washing machine and tumble dryer.   There are two bedrooms both with storage and laminate flooring.  The bathroom is fully tiled and comes with the addition of a separate shower unit to the bath.  Gas central heating.  Communal parking within the development, refuse included.",
